1
00:00:46,671 --> 00:00:48,089
Astaga.

2
00:00:51,718 --> 00:00:52,719
Tuan Pengacara.

3
00:00:53,803 --> 00:00:55,221
Kau bisa mendengarku?

4
00:00:56,765 --> 00:00:57,682
Tuan Pengacara!

5
00:00:58,558 --> 00:00:59,684
Ya, kenapa?

6
00:00:59,768 --> 00:01:01,686
Mereka benar-benar menembakiku.

7
00:01:03,438 --> 00:01:04,773
Aku mau ditembak mati?

8
00:01:05,565 --> 00:01:08,985
Ya, mereka membatasi mobilitasmu.

9
00:01:11,279 --> 00:01:12,947
Memang selalu terbatas.

10
00:01:13,865 --> 00:01:16,618
Oke. Bertahanlah sebentar.

11
00:02:27,605 --> 00:02:28,982
Sial!

12
00:02:52,463 --> 00:02:54,841
Urus Mundane Vanguard
lalu ke Ruang Kepala Cabang.

13
00:02:56,176 --> 00:02:57,051
RUANG KEPALA CABANG

14
00:02:57,927 --> 00:03:01,055
Kau bisa langsung
ke brankas rahasia lewat sana.

15
00:03:01,139 --> 00:03:03,558
Aku akan turun jika kalian sudah siap.

16
00:03:20,575 --> 00:03:21,576
Astaga!

17
00:03:24,621 --> 00:03:26,497
Roti-mi, cepat ke sini!

18
00:03:29,459 --> 00:03:31,211
Aduh, cobalah bertahan!

19
00:03:46,309 --> 00:03:48,186
BANK TABUNGAN GIMHAE

20
00:03:57,946 --> 00:04:00,490
Tangkap Kang Sang-ung dulu.
Jangan sampai direbut.

21
00:04:00,573 --> 00:04:02,033
Baik!

22
00:04:38,945 --> 00:04:41,781
- Aduh, aku mau muntah. Kekenyangan.
- Hei!

23
00:04:44,534 --> 00:04:45,952
Kenapa lama sekali?

24
00:04:46,035 --> 00:04:47,870
Apa? Harusnya aku datang nanti.

25
00:04:47,954 --> 00:04:50,290
- Temukan Kang Sang-ung!
- Itu mereka.

26
00:04:58,881 --> 00:05:01,426
Mundane Vanguard dan Jo Anna harus beradu.

27
00:05:01,509 --> 00:05:04,470
Maka, kita takkan dihentikan atau dikejar.

28
00:05:05,305 --> 00:05:08,516
Hanya kita yang masuk ke brankas.

29
00:05:11,019 --> 00:05:13,187
Tuan Pengacara,
kami ke Ruang Kepala Cabang.

30
00:05:17,608 --> 00:05:18,693
Jangan ke sini.

31
00:05:20,737 --> 00:05:21,738
Tuan Pengacara?

32
00:05:22,405 --> 00:05:24,073
- Tuan Pengacara!
- Terputus?

33
00:05:24,824 --> 00:05:25,992
Ayo cepat pergi.

34
00:05:30,997 --> 00:05:34,292
RUANG KEPALA CABANG

35
00:05:41,424 --> 00:05:42,508
Harus cepat turun.

36
00:06:22,548 --> 00:06:25,385
Tuan Pengacara? Tuan Pengacara!

37
00:06:28,137 --> 00:06:29,138
Tuan Pengacara!

38
00:06:31,599 --> 00:06:33,393
Kau tak apa, Tuan Pengacara?

39
00:07:21,190 --> 00:07:23,526
Kau selalu melampaui ekspektasi.

40
00:07:26,237 --> 00:07:29,323
Kekuatan supermu memang yang terbaik
selama ada uang.

41
00:07:32,827 --> 00:07:33,661
Namun,

42
00:07:34,412 --> 00:07:35,955
uangmu sisa sedikit, 'kan?

43
00:07:48,509 --> 00:07:50,428
Masih cukup untuk membungkammu.

44
00:07:55,766 --> 00:07:58,478
Produk baru yang menarik
akan segera beredar.

45
00:08:01,939 --> 00:08:02,773
Hei.

46
00:08:03,483 --> 00:08:05,860
Kau dapat apa jika melakukan ini?

47
00:08:05,943 --> 00:08:07,487
Tentu saja uang.

48
00:08:07,570 --> 00:08:11,240
Aku perlu banyak uang
untuk memakai kekuatanmu dengan benar.

49
00:08:28,341 --> 00:08:29,592
SILAKAN ISI KALORI

50
00:08:33,054 --> 00:08:33,971
Hanya itu?

51
00:08:36,140 --> 00:08:37,308
Aku kecewa berat.

52
00:08:41,479 --> 00:08:43,147
Hari ini akan berat.

53
00:08:53,449 --> 00:08:54,325
Tidak.

54
00:08:55,034 --> 00:08:56,827
Min-suk janji cerita hal lucu.

55
00:08:57,328 --> 00:08:58,704
Aku harus cepat pulang.

56
00:09:30,111 --> 00:09:31,696
Kau ke sini!

57
00:09:44,542 --> 00:09:46,085
Mau minum alkohol juga?

58
00:09:54,719 --> 00:09:55,928
Tuan Pengacara!

59
00:09:56,429 --> 00:09:59,223
Tuan Pengacara, Roti-mi!
Kalian mendengarku?

60
00:09:59,807 --> 00:10:00,808
Tuan Pengacara!

61
00:10:10,026 --> 00:10:11,569
Bau yang sangat menyengat.

62
00:10:15,156 --> 00:10:18,367
Aku bisa tahu meski tak melihatnya.

63
00:10:20,536 --> 00:10:22,038
Bau yang anehnya kukenal,

64
00:10:23,372 --> 00:10:26,292
tetapi juga selalu
tak tergapai dan kudambakan.

65
00:10:28,461 --> 00:10:30,046
Bau tajam ini adalah…

66
00:10:35,676 --> 00:10:36,677
uang.

67
00:10:45,394 --> 00:10:47,438
Apa yang lucu? Kita akan mati.

68
00:10:52,652 --> 00:10:54,028
BRANKAS RUBANAH

69
00:10:55,404 --> 00:10:57,531
Ada apa di balik dinding itu?

70
00:10:58,324 --> 00:10:59,450
Saluran pembuangan?

71
00:11:02,203 --> 00:11:05,331
Bau busuknya sama, tapi bukan itu.

72
00:11:06,499 --> 00:11:07,375
Lalu apa?

73
00:11:10,628 --> 00:11:15,591
Menurut cetak biru,
ukuran tempat ini 17 meter kali 11 meter.

74
00:11:18,636 --> 00:11:20,680
Padahal, tak seluas itu.

75
00:12:12,690 --> 00:12:16,944
Aku merasa tenang.
Uang memang membuat percaya diri.

76
00:12:28,164 --> 00:12:28,998
Hai.

77
00:12:32,752 --> 00:12:34,128
Tuan Sang-ung.

78
00:12:35,463 --> 00:12:36,464
Paman.

79
00:12:41,051 --> 00:12:42,595
Jangan panggil paman.

80
00:12:47,016 --> 00:12:49,018
Uangnya di sana, ya?

81
00:12:58,694 --> 00:13:00,946
Celengan ayahmu luar biasa.

82
00:13:05,743 --> 00:13:10,331
Roti-mi, keluarlah dengan Tuan Pengacara.
Tujuanku bertemu bajingan ini.

83
00:13:12,249 --> 00:13:13,876
Jadi, aku harus berpamitan.

84
00:13:14,460 --> 00:13:16,754
Aku duluan. Ayo, Roti-mi.

85
00:13:56,335 --> 00:14:01,215
Aku tahu uang itu penting,
tapi tak menyangka sejauh ini.

86
00:15:00,316 --> 00:15:01,609
Kau terlihat prima.

87
00:15:05,404 --> 00:15:06,739
Uanglah yang prima.

88
00:15:07,948 --> 00:15:10,409
Kau tak bisa melihat sekitarmu, ya?

89
00:15:28,344 --> 00:15:30,679
Tidak, aku bisa lihat segalanya.

90
00:15:58,040 --> 00:15:59,249
Satu pukulan saja.

91
00:16:33,867 --> 00:16:34,868
Apa?

92
00:16:43,085 --> 00:16:45,004
Aku tak tahu apa yang terjadi.

93
00:16:46,797 --> 00:16:51,010
Rasanya seperti tak ingat apa pun
setelah mabuk semalam.

94
00:17:07,234 --> 00:17:09,945
Kekuatan superku tak berfungsi.

95
00:17:16,368 --> 00:17:17,202
Apa?

96
00:17:17,286 --> 00:17:19,872
Kami tak menangkapmu. Tenang saja.

97
00:17:21,623 --> 00:17:22,916
Sial.

98
00:17:39,099 --> 00:17:41,268
- Dia sedang apa?
- Apa benar begitu?

99
00:17:46,106 --> 00:17:46,940
Turun.

100
00:17:47,941 --> 00:17:50,694
- Tanpa kekuatanmu, kau tak macam-macam.
- Apa?

101
00:17:51,195 --> 00:17:53,864
- Turun!
- Tunggu sebentar.

102
00:17:56,784 --> 00:17:57,618
Jo Nathan

103
00:17:58,744 --> 00:18:00,287
jual obat pengklona kekuatan.

104
00:18:01,205 --> 00:18:04,500
- Akan kucek.
- Jangan dicek. Tangkap dia sekarang!

105
00:18:10,047 --> 00:18:13,759
Sudah kubilang, 'kan?
Lebih banyak yang akan terancam karenamu.

106
00:18:16,470 --> 00:18:18,222
Kenapa ini gara-gara aku?

107
00:18:18,972 --> 00:18:20,724
Kau mau aku diam saja

108
00:18:20,808 --> 00:18:23,227
dan membiarkan dunia hancur?

109
00:18:23,310 --> 00:18:25,479
Apa baru sekarang dunia dalam bahaya?

110
00:18:26,814 --> 00:18:29,775
Mungkin kau tak tahu,
tapi dunia tak pernah aman.

111
00:18:29,858 --> 00:18:33,362
Bahaya serupa Mundane Vanguard
dan obat pengklona selalu ada.

112
00:18:34,780 --> 00:18:39,201
Perang ini dimulai sebelum kita lahir
dan takkan berakhir meski kita mati.

113
00:18:42,287 --> 00:18:46,333
Bertarung tak harus berhadapan.
Kau tak bertarung sendirian.

114
00:18:46,416 --> 00:18:48,585
- Turun.
- Ya, ampun!

115
00:18:51,839 --> 00:18:53,757
Aku lapar. Ayo pergi!

116
00:19:13,819 --> 00:19:16,655
BANK TABUNGAN GIMHAE

117
00:19:28,208 --> 00:19:29,835
Kembalikan ke laboratorium.

118
00:19:29,918 --> 00:19:30,752
Baik.

119
00:19:36,341 --> 00:19:38,468
- Di mana Lee Su-eun?
- Belum ketemu.

120
00:19:39,052 --> 00:19:39,970
Cepat tangkap.

121
00:19:50,981 --> 00:19:51,982
Wah!

122
00:20:13,378 --> 00:20:14,713
Apa-apaan kalian?

123
00:20:18,717 --> 00:20:20,093
Letakkan!

124
00:20:24,848 --> 00:20:28,101
Ya, ampun. Gerah sekali. Ayo lepas!

125
00:20:46,620 --> 00:20:49,957
Akhirnya, aku bisa ke sini
berkat menantuku.

126
00:20:51,583 --> 00:20:53,210
Siapa kau?

127
00:20:56,004 --> 00:20:57,547
Kau putrinya Jo Won-do?

128
00:20:58,048 --> 00:20:59,633
Kau mirip ayahmu.

129
00:21:01,260 --> 00:21:02,386
Tidak.

130
00:21:04,137 --> 00:21:07,140
Jangan macam-macam. Diamlah di situ.

131
00:21:09,559 --> 00:21:11,270
Aku tak ada urusan denganmu.

132
00:21:12,229 --> 00:21:13,355
Sial.

133
00:21:42,634 --> 00:21:45,470
Kau pingsan usai bertarung
pakai uang orang lain.

134
00:21:46,471 --> 00:21:47,931
Ketika bangun,

135
00:21:49,641 --> 00:21:51,143
kekuatanmu tak berfungsi?

136
00:21:52,102 --> 00:21:52,936
Ya.

137
00:21:56,815 --> 00:21:57,941
Itu sudah limit.

138
00:21:59,067 --> 00:22:00,527
Lagi-lagi omong kosong.

139
00:22:01,028 --> 00:22:02,529
Aku bukan kartu kredit.

140
00:22:02,612 --> 00:22:05,574
- Apa?
- Kau kewalahan memakai kekuatanmu.

141
00:22:10,037 --> 00:22:11,163
Sadarlah!

142
00:22:18,879 --> 00:22:22,174
Ayah bilang sejak awal,
jangan pakai uang orang lain.

143
00:22:22,758 --> 00:22:24,468
Astaga.

144
00:22:24,551 --> 00:22:27,012
Aku kira itu hanya larangan biasa

145
00:22:27,095 --> 00:22:29,681
untuk tak memakai uang orang lain.

146
00:22:34,061 --> 00:22:35,103
Jadi…

147
00:22:36,396 --> 00:22:37,898
kapan kekuatanku kembali?

148
00:22:37,981 --> 00:22:39,191
Ayah tak tahu.

149
00:22:40,901 --> 00:22:43,278
Seperti itulah dunia bekerja.

150
00:22:43,362 --> 00:22:45,197
Tak boleh terlalu serakah.

151
00:22:45,781 --> 00:22:48,116
Baik itu uang, makanan, maupun alkohol.

152
00:22:48,867 --> 00:22:51,745
Kau hancur jika melewati batasmu.

153
00:22:54,998 --> 00:22:56,166
Kalau begitu,

154
00:22:57,292 --> 00:22:59,503
sejak awal pertarungan ini tak adil.

155
00:23:01,463 --> 00:23:05,884
Ini tidak adil jika aku pakai uangku,
tetapi lawanku sangat kuat!

156
00:23:06,385 --> 00:23:10,013
Harusnya Ayah cari uang lebih banyak
sebelum wariskan kekuatan kepadaku!

157
00:23:10,514 --> 00:23:11,348
Sang-ung.

158
00:23:12,349 --> 00:23:15,477
- Ini bukan perang uang.
- Ini perang uang. Ayah tahu!

159
00:23:15,560 --> 00:23:17,020
Apa maksud Ayah?

160
00:23:17,104 --> 00:23:19,689
- Andai tak ada kekuatan super?
- Astaga.

161
00:23:20,774 --> 00:23:21,983
Apa kau tak bertarung?

162
00:23:24,236 --> 00:23:28,323
Jika tak ada kekuatan super,
kau hanya akan menonton mereka?

163
00:23:32,369 --> 00:23:34,746
Tidak banyak orang yang rela

164
00:23:35,705 --> 00:23:39,126
memakai uang 30 juta
dari ibunya untuk menolong orang lain.

165
00:23:40,585 --> 00:23:44,131
Bukan kekuatan super
yang menolong mereka waktu itu.

166
00:23:44,714 --> 00:23:45,841
Itu kau.

167
00:24:10,907 --> 00:24:12,284
Pikirkanlah baik-baik.

168
00:24:14,536 --> 00:24:15,662
Kekuatan kita

169
00:24:17,289 --> 00:24:18,790
tak berasal dari uang.

170
00:24:21,209 --> 00:24:22,294
Seraya bertarung…

171
00:24:31,636 --> 00:24:32,929
dan melindungi sesuatu…

172
00:24:36,308 --> 00:24:37,934
kau akan tersadar.

173
00:24:42,981 --> 00:24:44,858
Bahwa uang tidaklah penting.

174
00:24:51,615 --> 00:24:55,410
Kau bisa memakai kekuatanmu lagi
jika menyadari itu.

175
00:25:48,630 --> 00:25:49,839
MUNDANE VANGUARD

176
00:25:53,635 --> 00:25:54,469
Sial.

177
00:26:06,815 --> 00:26:10,735
Tubuhmu tak sanggup
menerima kekuatan super dia.

178
00:26:31,506 --> 00:26:35,343
Bagimu, hidup seperti orang bodoh
lebih menyiksa daripada mati.

179
00:26:37,387 --> 00:26:39,472
Itulah harga diri.

180
00:26:39,556 --> 00:26:41,891
Tanpa itu, tak ada yang tersisa darimu.

181
00:26:52,360 --> 00:26:55,280
DARI SEOUL KE LOS ANGELES

182
00:27:03,872 --> 00:27:04,706
Pak Ketua Jo.

183
00:27:06,166 --> 00:27:07,542
JO ANNA

184
00:27:09,461 --> 00:27:10,545
Ada apa?

185
00:27:11,296 --> 00:27:15,759
Bagaimanapun, ada hal
yang tak bisa kau pisahkan dari seseorang.

186
00:27:16,384 --> 00:27:18,386
DEBITUR: JO SHIN-IL
KREDITUR: PARK HYEONG-DO

187
00:27:19,471 --> 00:27:22,432
Kebenaran dan uangku.

188
00:27:25,268 --> 00:27:27,354
Memang di dunia ini ada uangmu?

189
00:27:27,937 --> 00:27:29,773
Menurut buku kas ini, ada.

190
00:27:31,858 --> 00:27:35,528
Lama sekali untuk menemukan kembali
apa yang kausembunyikan.

191
00:27:39,908 --> 00:27:42,452
Butuh ratusan tahun untuk membangun…

192
00:27:44,371 --> 00:27:47,165
tetapi hanya perlu semalam untuk hancur.

193
00:27:49,918 --> 00:27:52,629
Aku tak sedermawan ayahku.

194
00:27:54,714 --> 00:27:58,093
Tetaplah sehat
sampai kau melunasi utangmu padaku.

195
00:28:06,518 --> 00:28:07,519
Terima kasih.

196
00:28:10,980 --> 00:28:12,649
Kau akan menyesal.

197
00:28:13,233 --> 00:28:16,486
Kaulah yang menyesal saat ini.

198
00:28:19,614 --> 00:28:21,825
Sementara, akan kusimpan uang ini.

199
00:28:22,826 --> 00:28:24,828
- Bawa.
- Baik!

200
00:28:46,766 --> 00:28:48,435
Apa hebatnya kekuatan super?

201
00:28:49,310 --> 00:28:53,982
Setelah diambil lagi, stamina dan mentalku

202
00:28:54,691 --> 00:28:56,234
semakin melemah.

203
00:29:15,003 --> 00:29:16,004
Min-suk.

204
00:29:21,634 --> 00:29:22,761
Min-suk.

205
00:29:25,722 --> 00:29:27,432
Hei, Min-suk!

206
00:29:27,515 --> 00:29:28,600
Min…

207
00:29:30,351 --> 00:29:31,352
Min-suk!

208
00:29:33,104 --> 00:29:34,314
Sial.

209
00:29:49,287 --> 00:29:50,121
Astaga.

210
00:29:52,207 --> 00:29:54,417
- Halo.
- Aku sangat terkesan tadi.

211
00:29:59,589 --> 00:30:00,590
Di mana Min-suk?

212
00:30:09,849 --> 00:30:11,726
Sang-ung, aku tak apa-apa.

213
00:30:12,811 --> 00:30:14,062
Jangan terlalu cemas.

214
00:30:15,897 --> 00:30:18,149
Min-suk, kau tak apa-apa?

215
00:30:19,442 --> 00:30:21,361
Bersabarlah. Aku segera ke sana. Tunggu…

216
00:30:22,153 --> 00:30:24,364
Kenapa kau memperumit keadaan?

217
00:30:27,659 --> 00:30:28,910
Apa maumu?

218
00:30:29,911 --> 00:30:31,037
Selalu kau.

219
00:30:32,455 --> 00:30:33,790
Oke. Aku ke sana.

220
00:30:34,749 --> 00:30:36,042
Aku ke sana. Min-suk…

221
00:30:37,919 --> 00:30:39,546
Hei!

222
00:30:39,629 --> 00:30:44,008
Bajingan! Kubilang aku akan ke sana!

223
00:30:52,392 --> 00:30:53,852
Aku yang memutuskan.

224
00:30:55,520 --> 00:30:57,063
Tunggu saja dengan tenang.

225
00:31:01,526 --> 00:31:02,861
Sialan.

226
00:31:04,529 --> 00:31:06,447
Ponsel tidak aktif.

227
00:31:16,374 --> 00:31:18,209
Kaukira kau akan menang?

228
00:31:19,377 --> 00:31:21,296
Kau takkan bisa mengalahkan Kang Sang-ung.

229
00:31:22,422 --> 00:31:23,840
Kenapa berpikir begitu?

230
00:31:26,342 --> 00:31:27,552
Sang-ung…

231
00:31:30,388 --> 00:31:31,806
payah dalam perhitungan.

232
00:31:33,600 --> 00:31:37,186
Dia melakukan segala hal
yang menurutnya benar.

233
00:31:37,270 --> 00:31:40,481
Meski itu hal yang mustahil dan merugikan.

234
00:31:42,734 --> 00:31:44,903
Pantas saja dia tak punya uang.

235
00:31:46,154 --> 00:31:48,531
Tidak, dia memang tak pernah punya uang.

236
00:31:51,200 --> 00:31:55,246
Kenapa mau dengan pria yang pakai uangnya
demi membantu orang lain?

237
00:31:55,330 --> 00:31:57,665
Hei! Justru sebaliknya.

238
00:31:58,249 --> 00:32:00,501
Dia penurut, jadi, dia mau denganku.

239
00:32:01,002 --> 00:32:04,130
Namun, aku harap dia hanya patuh kepadaku.

240
00:32:05,506 --> 00:32:06,466
Mengharukan.

241
00:32:07,050 --> 00:32:08,760
Jelas. Kami kini suami istri.

242
00:32:12,138 --> 00:32:14,682
Aku merasa seperti kau merebut suamiku.

243
00:32:16,267 --> 00:32:17,852
Pertemuan keluarga rusak karenamu.

244
00:32:18,853 --> 00:32:20,813
Kami bahkan tak bisa resepsi!

245
00:32:26,986 --> 00:32:28,237
Kau akan kalah.

246
00:32:29,405 --> 00:32:30,406
Lihat saja nanti.

247
00:32:31,074 --> 00:32:32,617
Ucapan siapa yang benar.

248
00:32:54,973 --> 00:32:56,265
Jangan bergerak!

249
00:33:15,535 --> 00:33:18,204
Jo Nathan jual obat pengklona kekuatan.

250
00:33:18,287 --> 00:33:21,374
- Akan kucek.
- Jangan dicek. Tangkap dia sekarang!

251
00:33:29,007 --> 00:33:31,759
Kenapa ke Gimhae
jika tak menangkap siapa pun?

252
00:33:32,343 --> 00:33:33,970
Ada apa sebenarnya?

253
00:33:38,141 --> 00:33:40,601
Kenapa kau melepaskan Kang Sang-ung?

254
00:33:43,062 --> 00:33:44,856
Karena dia tidak bersalah.

255
00:33:47,775 --> 00:33:50,403
Dia membobol brankas.
Masa, tidak bersalah?

256
00:33:54,407 --> 00:33:58,036
Ada hal yang lebih penting
daripada uang di dunia ini.

257
00:33:58,828 --> 00:34:00,038
Kalian tahu apa itu?

258
00:34:01,372 --> 00:34:02,206
Apa?

259
00:34:04,751 --> 00:34:05,752
Waktu.

260
00:34:08,171 --> 00:34:11,174
Karena itulah
kita selalu kekurangan waktu.

261
00:34:40,578 --> 00:34:41,788
Kau tampan.

262
00:34:52,298 --> 00:34:54,133
Lain kali jangan terlambat.

263
00:35:41,222 --> 00:35:42,473
Di mana Min-suk?

264
00:35:42,557 --> 00:35:45,434
Sebelum itu, aku akan melakukan tes.

265
00:35:59,282 --> 00:36:02,034
- Tes apa?
- Kau pingsan di brankas, ya?

266
00:36:03,161 --> 00:36:06,914
Kami tak perlu buang-buang waktu
jika kau produk rusak.

267
00:36:09,417 --> 00:36:10,585
Aku baru sadar.

268
00:36:11,794 --> 00:36:13,087
Tanpa kekuatan super,

269
00:36:13,588 --> 00:36:16,799
aku tak berguna bagi mereka.

270
00:36:22,221 --> 00:36:25,224
Jika kau menang, kuantar kau padanya.

271
00:36:26,934 --> 00:36:28,186
Jika kau kalah…

272
00:36:33,649 --> 00:36:34,984
wanita itu dan kau

273
00:36:35,985 --> 00:36:37,320
akan mati.

274
00:36:38,946 --> 00:36:39,780
Maaf.

275
00:36:40,948 --> 00:36:43,201
Aku harus dengar cerita lucu Min-suk.

276
00:36:44,702 --> 00:36:46,370
Aku tak boleh mati dulu.

277
00:37:52,019 --> 00:37:53,020
Min-suk…

278
00:37:54,772 --> 00:37:55,773
ada di mana?

279
00:38:39,775 --> 00:38:41,694
Kenapa? Katamu lihat semuanya?

280
00:38:52,913 --> 00:38:54,290
Di mana Min-suk?

281
00:38:59,253 --> 00:39:01,047
Di mana Min-suk? Sial!

282
00:39:09,972 --> 00:39:11,515
Kekuatanmu tak berfungsi?

283
00:39:13,476 --> 00:39:17,480
- Kalian berdua harus dimusnahkan.
- Aku tak ada urusan denganmu.

284
00:39:22,193 --> 00:39:23,235
Katakan.

285
00:39:25,321 --> 00:39:26,364
Min-suk

286
00:39:28,074 --> 00:39:29,075
ada di mana?

287
00:39:31,994 --> 00:39:32,870
Kau mati dulu.

288
00:40:06,278 --> 00:40:08,614
Jangan bergerak atau tubuhmu bolong.

289
00:40:56,787 --> 00:40:59,665
PENGACARA PERCERAIAN, BYEON HO-IN

290
00:41:03,085 --> 00:41:05,129
BEOMHA LOGISTIK

291
00:41:05,212 --> 00:41:06,088
Di sini.

292
00:41:15,014 --> 00:41:16,390
DENAH LANTAI 1 BEOMHA LOGISTIK

293
00:41:16,974 --> 00:41:19,226
Mundane Vanguard menjaga semua akses.

294
00:41:20,019 --> 00:41:21,228
PENAMPANG LINTANG…

295
00:41:21,812 --> 00:41:23,105
Min-suk pun begitu.

296
00:41:24,899 --> 00:41:27,109
Masuk ke sana sama dengan bunuh diri.

297
00:41:33,949 --> 00:41:37,036
Kita akan mati.
Tak hanya Min-suk, tapi kita juga!

298
00:41:38,537 --> 00:41:40,164
Sulit meski punya kekuatan.

299
00:41:40,247 --> 00:41:41,624
Saat pertama bertemu,

300
00:41:42,750 --> 00:41:44,710
kau bertanya kenapa aku menolong

301
00:41:45,461 --> 00:41:48,255
orang-orang di kecelakaan bus.

302
00:41:53,677 --> 00:41:56,055
Itu sudah kewajiban. Tak ada alasan.

303
00:41:57,473 --> 00:42:01,310
Andai tak punya kekuatan pun
tetap kulakukan dengan cara apa pun.

304
00:42:05,564 --> 00:42:07,816
Kau tak bisa mengutamakan perasaan.

305
00:42:08,359 --> 00:42:10,986
Situasi ini tak masuk akal perhitungan!

306
00:42:20,871 --> 00:42:22,414
Perhitunganku payah.

307
00:42:46,188 --> 00:42:51,944
BEOMHA LOGISTIK

308
00:43:21,807 --> 00:43:24,893
Sekarang aku mengerti maksud Ayah.

309
00:43:26,395 --> 00:43:29,440
Kekuatanku tak berasal dari uang.

310
00:43:32,026 --> 00:43:33,110
Kekuatanku ada

311
00:43:34,153 --> 00:43:37,990
demi melindungi hal
yang lebih penting dari uang.

312
00:44:11,315 --> 00:44:12,316
Min-suk.

313
00:44:13,901 --> 00:44:15,486
Aku takkan terlambat lagi.

314
00:47:23,590 --> 00:47:26,802
Terjemahan subtitle oleh Siti Muthia Hasna
